1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,354
A favourite trap.

2
00:00:01,354 --> 00:00:05,703
The iodoform test is not a test for alcohols in general.

3
00:00:05,703 --> 00:00:15,468
It works only for ethanol and alcohols with the C H three C H O H group, like propan two ol, and for methyl ketones.

4
00:00:15,468 --> 00:00:19,960
Methanol and propan one ol give no yellow precipitate.

